      "could_be_applied_to": "Characterize MaxSim expressiveness by analyzing the alignment matrix A: MaxSim uses A = argmax (hard assignment), cross-encoders use A = softmax (soft assignment), dot product uses A = I (identity). The rank and structure of A directly determine the expressiveness of the scoring function — formalizing this would yield a clean expressiveness hierarchy."
